/v1/","context":{"app_id":4993800,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4993800-1846651706685651","game_id":"steam-4993800","kind":"update","title":"October Update","summary":"Whats NewNew title screenNew seed screenShelves have more depth: a themed column now pays 6% and a full themed shelf 8%, a slot you empty in the morning stays empty for the day, and new Work Gloves give two extra shelf actions each morningFilling a slot now shows how long each product keeps, what it does, and the fitting’s bonusSlot fittings stack up to two per slot, the fitting screen names the venue you’re upgrading, and placing fittings is easier, with a warning when there’s no roomThe day re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:17:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685651","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993800-1846018067936851","game_id":"steam-4993800","kind":"update","title":"Game Update","summary":"What's NewNew shaped slot upgrades: the Light Bar covers three slots in a line, the Chiller Drawer a 2x2 block, and the Featured Line a whole shelf or column.Contracts can turn up at the end of a week: put up with a tax hike or a boycott for a few days and walk away with cash, a lighter quota, or a craze on one of your products. Decline and nothing changes.A running contract sits in a small icon on the top bar showing its days left, and a toast tells you when a craze kicks in.The themed shelf no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:31:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993800-1846018067930128","game_id":"steam-4993800","kind":"update","title":"Game Update","summary":"Whats New!ShelvingEach morning you get 3 shelf actions per machine. Hand-fill an empty slot with whatever you want from the stockroom, or pull something that isn't selling. The random restock still fills the rest, so if you'd rather not bother, the game plays the same as before.Where you put things now matters too:- Eye-level chill: two or more cold products on the top shelf, and cold sales from that row pay 10% more.- Kid-height sweets: where kids come by, sweets on the bottom shelf pay 15% mor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:21:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993800-1842212951295313","game_id":"steam-4993800","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"What's New- A big shake-up of the machine upgrades: every rarity tier is now worth its slot, restock and crowd-drawing upgrades scale with the venue you're in, and weekly quotas got a touch friendlier to match- Perishables are a real strategy now. Fresh-focused upgrades pay extra on every perishable sale, and each perishable in the machine shows how many days it has left, going red when it's about to turn- Upgrade cards warn you when a pick won't do anything for your current stock- Repairs are c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T23:41:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295313","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-st